  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "さまざまな　おとの　ボリュームを\nじゆうじざいに　コントロール　できる\nふしぎで　すごいみみせん。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "다양한 소리의 볼륨을\n자유자재로 조절할 수 있는\n신기하고 대단한 귀마개.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "神奇又厲害的耳塞。\n可以自由調節各種聲音的音量。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cet objet incroyable permet de contrôler librement\nle volume sonore de divers éléments.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mit diesen rätselhaften Ohrenstöpseln kann man die\nLautstärke verschiedener Geräuschquellen regulieren.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Curiosos auriculares que permiten ajustar de forma\nindependiente el volumen de distintos elementos\nsonoros.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tappi per le orecchie misteriosi che permettono\na chi li indossa di regolare a proprio piacimento\nil volume di diversi suoni.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Strange earbuds that allow you to freely control the\nvolume of various sounds.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "さまざまな　音の　ボリュームを\n自由自在に　コントロール　できる\n不思議で　すごいみみせん。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这个神奇又厉害的耳塞\n可以自由调节各种声音的音量。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Curiosos auriculares que permiten ajustar de forma\nindependiente el volumen de distintos elementos\nsonoros.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
